ric distance. On it the metric is $dy^2 + c^2t^2d\\chi^2$ with $\\chi$ periodic in $\\psi_0/2$, so each moment is a flat cylinder of circumference $\\psi_0c|t|/2$, here $2\\pi c|t|$.","The cylinders narrow as $t$ climbs toward $0$, where the circles become the closed null geodesics of the chronology horizon. Beyond it, where $T > 0$, the same circles are closed timelike curves."]}]}
